    <h3>Teams & Companies</h3>
    <p class="audience-card__lead">Bring team thinking and specialized AI models together for smarter, faster business decisions.</p>
    <ul class="audience-card__list">
      <li><strong>Collaborative Research:</strong> Synthesize industry reports, analyze competitor strategies, and summarize market data.</li>
      <li><strong>Shared Content & Strategy:</strong> Draft product specs, sales proposals, marketing campaigns, and investor memos together.</li>
      <li><strong>Multi-Model Perspectives:</strong> Compare answers from GPT-4o, Claude 3.5, and Gemini Pro in a single discussion thread.</li>
      <li><strong>Role-Based Privacy:</strong> Keep sensitive client or corporate credentials private while delegating AI access to team members.</li>
    </ul>
